|i5 : A = action(I,S3)                                   |
|                                                        |
|o5 = Ideal with 3 actors                                |
|                                                        |
|o5 : ActionOnGradedModule                               |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : B = action(J,S3)                                   |
|                                                        |
