|i7 : a = character(A,1)                                 |
|                                                        |
|o7 = Character over QQ                                  |
|                                                        |
|     (0, {1})  |  1  1  1                               |
|                                                        |
|o7 : Character                                          |
+--------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : b = character(B,1)                                 |
|                                                        |
|o8 = Character over QQ                                  |
|                                                        |
