The unique simple group of order 168 acts as described in §2.2 of BDHHSS (see
https://doi.org/10.1093/imrn/rnx329 ). In particular, the group is generated by
the elements g of order 7, h of order 3, and i of order 2, and is minimally
defined over the 7th cyclotomic field. In addition, we consider the identity,
